                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f19faa5-0726-4223-aab1-906775995f8d",
                                "sense_id": "41649e01-5c88-35b8-84c4-a119c3087224",
                                "text": "It is an ignorant conceit, that enquiry into nature should make men atheous: no man is so apt to see the star of Christ, as a diligent disciple of philosophy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a14d3f9b-ad6f-47d7-a03e-aa6f2953248f",
                                "sense_id": "41649e01-5c88-35b8-84c4-a119c3087224",
                                "text": "Thy Father, who is holy, wiſe and pure,\nSuffers the Hypocrite or Atheous Prieſt\nTo tread his Sacred Courts..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f3824b6-44c3-47a6-9b16-a539003baad6",
                                "sense_id": "41649e01-5c88-35b8-84c4-a119c3087224",
                                "text": "In atheous men conscience becomes a scourge."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a92ea15-bbdc-34ed-b386-488f236c1711",
                        "entry_id": "c2fb5ad3-370d-36de-81e8-1c195956170a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Without God, neither accepting nor denying him."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5efab363-1887-4209-9bd6-ac3c3079948a",
                                "sense_id": "3a92ea15-bbdc-34ed-b386-488f236c1711",
                                "text": "I should say science was atheous, and therefore could not be atheistic."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
